当前任务数据：{"session_id":"session_692afd19c6ac4d4a8b1c535168bdb40e","topic":"LoCoMo official pilot","project_id":null,"goal":"Caroline aims to adopt and create a family for kids in need","plan":[],"pending_tasks":[],"summary":"Melanie shares that pottery is a huge part of her life, not just a hobby, helping her express emotions and bringing her joy; she is excited to see where pottery takes her. Caroline says she is going to a transgender conference this month, excited to meet others in the community and learn about advocacy. The conversation ends with Caroline and Melanie exchanging goodbyes and well-wishes.","processed_sequence":92,"revision":111,"created_at":"2026-10-13T02:23:59.690022Z","updated_at":"2026-10-13T02:25:07.406457Z"}
