【来源1】{"claim": "Caroline is keen on counseling or working in mental health, and would love to support those with similar issues.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "local_override": false, "origin": "compressed_memory"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "Caroline", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2023-05-08T13:56:00+00:00", "text": "Caroline: I'm keen on counseling or working in mental health - I'd love to support those with similar issues.", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源2】{"claim": "Caroline expects being a single parent to be tough but is up for the challenge.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "local_override": false, "origin": "compressed_memory"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "Caroline", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2023-05-25T13:14:00+00:00", "text": "Caroline: I'm thrilled to make a family for kids who need one. It'll be tough as a single parent, but I'm up for the challenge!", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源3】{"claim": "Caroline agrees that hanging with loved ones brings happiness and says family is everything.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "local_override": false, "origin": "compressed_memory"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "Caroline", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2023-06-09T19:55:00+00:00", "text": "Caroline: I 100% agree, Mel. Hanging with loved ones is amazing and brings so much happiness. Those moments really make me thankful. Family is everything.", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源4】{"claim": "Caroline's friends' love and help were especially important to her after a tough breakup.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "local_override": false, "origin": "compressed_memory"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "Caroline", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2023-06-09T19:55:00+00:00", "text": "Caroline: Yeah, I'm really lucky to have them. They've been there through everything, I've known these friends for 4 years, since I moved from my home country. Their love and help have been so important especially after that tough breakup. I'm super thankful. Who supports you, Mel?", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源5】{"claim": "Melanie cherishes time with family and says it is when she really feels alive and happy.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "local_override": false, "origin": "compressed_memory"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "Melanie", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2023-06-09T19:55:00+00:00", "text": "Melanie: Absolutely, Caroline! I cherish time with family. It's when I really feel alive and happy.", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源6】{"claim": "Melanie is carving out some me-time each day, which includes running, reading, or playing her violin.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "local_override": false, "origin": "compressed_memory"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "Melanie", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2023-05-25T13:14:00+00:00", "text": "Melanie: Yeah, it's tough. So I'm carving out some me-time each day - running, reading, or playing my violin - which refreshes me and helps me stay present for my fam!", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源7】{"claim": "Melanie asked Caroline whether the necklace has any special meaning.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "local_override": false, "origin": "compressed_memory"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "Melanie", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2023-06-27T10:37:00+00:00", "text": "Melanie: Hey, Caroline! Nice to hear from you! Love the necklace, any special meaning to it?", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源8】{"claim": "Melanie has been married for 5 years.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "local_override": false, "origin": "compressed_memory"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "Melanie", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2023-06-09T19:55:00+00:00", "text": "Melanie: [Image: a photo of a bride in a wedding dress holding a bouquet] 5 years already! Time flies- feels like just yesterday I put this dress on! Thanks, Caroline!", "context_only": false, "time_derivations": [{"expression": "yesterday", "start": "2023-06-08", "end_exclusive": "2023-06-09", "precision": "day", "rule": "source_relative_day"}]}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源9】{"claim": "Caroline says the charity race sounds great and that making a difference and raising awareness for mental health is super rewarding, and she is proud of Melanie for taking part.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "origin": "indexed_sweep"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "Caroline", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2023-05-25T13:14:00+00:00", "text": "Caroline: That charity race sounds great, Mel! Making a difference & raising awareness for mental health is super rewarding - I'm really proud of you for taking part!", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源10】{"claim": "Caroline's home country is Sweden.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "origin": "indexed_sweep"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "Caroline", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2023-06-27T10:37:00+00:00", "text": "Caroline: Thanks, Melanie! This necklace is super special to me - a gift from my grandma in my home country, Sweden. She gave it to me when I was young, and it stands for love, faith and strength. It's like a reminder of my roots and all the love and support I get from my family.", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源11】{"claim": "Caroline plans to attend a transgender conference this month (July 2023), and is excited to meet others in the community and learn more about advocacy.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "planned", "origin": "indexed_sweep"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "Caroline", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2023-07-03T13:36:00+00:00", "text": "Caroline: Thanks Mel! I'm going to a transgender conference this month. I'm so excited to meet other people in the community and learn more about advocacy. It's gonna be great!", "context_only": false, "time_derivations": [{"expression": "this month", "start": "2023-07-01", "end_exclusive": "2023-08-01", "precision": "month", "rule": "source_relative_month"}]}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源12】{"claim": "Caroline is looking into an adoption agency and shared an image of its sign.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "origin": "indexed_sweep"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "Caroline", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2023-05-25T13:14:00+00:00", "text": "Caroline: [Image: a photography of a sign for a new arrival and an information and domestic building] Thanks, Mel! My goal is to give kids a loving home. I'm truly grateful for all the support I've got from friends and mentors. Now the hard work starts to turn my dream into a reality. And here's one of the adoption agencies I'm looking into. It's a lot to take in, but I'm feeling hopeful and optimistic.", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源13】{"claim": "Caroline is passionate about creating a safe, inviting place for people to grow.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "origin": "indexed_sweep"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "Caroline", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2023-06-27T10:37:00+00:00", "text": "Caroline: Thanks, Melanie. It really mattered. My own journey and the support I got made a huge difference. Now I want to help people go through it too. I saw how counseling and support groups improved my life, so I started caring more about mental health and understanding myself. Now I'm passionate about creating a safe, inviting place for people to grow.", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源14】{"claim": "Caroline feels sharing experiences is important to promote understanding and acceptance, and wants to pass on the love and support she received.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "origin": "indexed_sweep"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "Caroline", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2023-06-09T19:55:00+00:00", "text": "Caroline: Thanks Mel! Your kind words mean a lot. Sharing our experiences isn't always easy, but I feel it's important to help promote understanding and acceptance. I've been blessed with loads of love and support throughout this journey, and I want to pass it on to others. By sharing our stories, we can build a strong, supportive community of hope.", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源15】{"claim": "Caroline believes conversations about gender identity and inclusion are necessary and is thankful for being able to give a voice to the trans community.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "origin": "indexed_sweep"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "Caroline", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2023-06-09T19:55:00+00:00", "text": "Caroline: Thanks, Mel! Your backing really means a lot. I felt super powerful giving my talk. I shared my own journey, the struggles I had and how much I've developed since coming out. It was wonderful to see how the audience related to what I said and how it inspired them to be better allies. Conversations about gender identity and inclusion are so necessary and I'm thankful for being able to give a voice to the trans community.", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源16】{"claim": "The pride parade motivated Caroline to use her story to help others, and she is still thinking that counseling and mental health is the way to go.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "origin": "indexed_sweep"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "Caroline", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2023-07-03T13:36:00+00:00", "text": "Caroline: Thanks, Mel! It really motivated me for sure. Talking to the community made me want to use my story to help others too - I'm still thinking that counseling and mental health is the way to go. I'm super excited to give back.", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源17】{"claim": "Caroline is learning to play the piano.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "origin": "indexed_sweep"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "Caroline", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2023-07-03T13:36:00+00:00", "text": "Caroline: Wow, Melanie! I'm getting creative too, just learning the piano. What made you try pottery?", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
